      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Welcome ​<user-mention data-id=\"108813\">@Rachana</user-mention>, to the community!</p><p>You will find a Spice model on the <a href=\"https://www.st.com/en/power-management/l7987l.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">product website of L7987L</a> the if you look in the CAD Resources tab. If you are unable to use it with LTspice, you can alternatively use the free simulation software <a href=\"https://www.st.com/en/embedded-software/stsw-edsim.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">STSW-eDSim</a>.</p><p>Hope that helps?</p><p>Regards<br/>/Peter</p></div>"
